Interchange StudentEnrollment [2530]
    documentation 'The Student Enrollment interchange describes student enrollments in schools and 
                  'in sections.
    use case documentation '1. Exchange school or LEA student enrollment lists.
                           '
                           '2. Exchange school enrollment accountability information.
                           '
                           '3. Exchange an individual student's enrollment history.
                           '
                           '4. Exchange students' class section enrollments.
                           '
                           '5. Exchange students' graduation plans.
    identity template Section [2530-001]
    element StudentSchoolAssociation [2530-002]
    element StudentSectionAssociation [2530-003]
    element GraduationPlan [2530-004]
    element StudentEducationOrganizationAssociation [2530-005]